    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X),Type.annotation(@f,Path(x,y))),def(Path.symm(f), , ))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "The **inverse path** $\\overline{f}$ of a path $f$ from $x_0$ to $x_1$ is the path from $x_1$ back to $x_0$ defined by $\\overline{f}(s)=f(1-s)$. Up to homotopy it is a two-sided inverse of $f$ (Hatcher p. 27).",
          "zh-CN": "从 $x_0$ 到 $x_1$ 的道路 $f$ 的**逆道路** $\\overline{f}$ 是由 $\\overline{f}(s)=f(1-s)$ 定义的、从 $x_1$ 回到 $x_0$ 的道路。在同伦意义下它是 $f$ 的双边逆（Hatcher 第 27 页）。"
        }
      }
    },
